            "pages": {
              "end": 40,
              "start": 40
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Chief Justice Roberts, chief Justice Roberts raised concerns about whether the government\u2019s answer of \u201ctrust us we\u2019ll treat you fairly\u201d satisfies First Amendment scrutiny."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Scalia",
        "citations": [
